              "name": "Comment (5)",
              "hint": "Hint",
              "content": "Transfer the buffer in VRAM to host memory (over the PCIe bus a.k.a Readback)\nand try to fill the ring buffer in a thread, while there is at least one empty slot\nin the ring buffer.",
